Dynamic connectivity index dc_stree_csr has been created with 12 edges.
-STATEMENT CALL CREATE_DYNAMIC_CONNECTIVITY_INDEX('Person', 'Knows', 'dc_dtree_csr', 'dtree_csr') RETURN *;
